unmotion: unMotion (paired-host VM migration for Unraid)
unmotion:
unmotion: unMotion provides cold and prepared Warm Move migration for Unraid
unmotion: KVM/libvirt VMs. It prefers ZFS full/incremental replication for
unmotion: zvols and dedicated per-VM datasets, with sparse rsync fallback.
unmotion: It also handles ISOs, UEFI NVRAM, TPM state, peer health,
unmotion: persistent jobs, resource checks, and safe ownership handoff.
